LOOT AND THE CHEST	战利品与宝箱
Every level has a *boss* asleep in a *lair* far from camp. *Find* it, then press [SPACE] there to *CHALLENGE* it: beat it before its clock runs out to open the *next level*!	每一关都有一个*首领*，沉睡在远离营地的*巢穴*里。*找到*它，然后在那里按 [SPACE] *挑战*它：在倒计时结束前击败它，就能开启*下一关*！
The run ends after the fight: farm first!	此战过后本局结束：先去刷一波！
