Between runs, spend your gold at camp: the *SKILL TREE* makes you stronger, the *WARBAND* equips items, *CARDS* give bonuses, the *SHOP* sells potions and Fly Wings. The *ADVENTURE BOOK* knows every slime you met.	每局之间，在营地花掉你的金币：*技能树*让你变强，*战团*用来装备物品，*卡牌*提供加成，*商店*出售药水和苍蝇翅膀。*冒险图鉴*记录着你遇到过的每一种史莱姆。
