Keeps inflating. Gets richer doing it.	越胀越大，腰包也越来越鼓。
CRYSTAL SLIME	水晶史莱姆
A slime of living glass.	由活体玻璃构成的史莱姆。
CRYSTAL SHARD	水晶碎片
What is left of a Crystal Slime.	水晶史莱姆碎掉后剩下的部分。
GHOST SLIME	幽灵史莱姆
Now you see it...	你看见它了……吗？
MIMIC	宝箱怪
That treasure chest has teeth.	那个宝箱……长着牙。
A legend of its land, with a name and a red aura.	当地的传奇怪物，有名有姓，还自带红光。
GOLDEN RUNNER	黄金跑者
Two sacks, two ways, one chance.	两只钱袋，两条路，一次机会。
TREASURE GOBLIN	宝藏哥布林
He has been helping himself to your gold.	他一直在顺手牵走你的金币。
SLIMELET	小史莱姆
Tiny, hungry and in a hurry.	个头小，胃口大，还总在赶路。
An old slime the forest grew over.	老到身上都长出森林的史莱姆。
*TOSS* a bug to crack its *SHELL*; a *rock* stops its *CHARGE*.	*投掷*虫子砸裂它的*硬壳*；用*岩石*挡住它的*冲锋*。
Ice cold, and always hungry.	冷若冰霜，饿得发慌。
DUNE TITAN	沙丘泰坦
The giant of the dunes.	沙丘上的巨人。
BOG LORD	沼泽领主
Rules the swamp from the bottom of it.	坐镇沼泽之底，统治整片沼泽。
TIDECALLER	唤潮者
It calls the tide, and the tide comes.	它一声召唤，潮水便应声而来。
MAGMA HEART	熔岩之心
A slime with a molten core.	内核是熔岩的史莱姆。
PRISM COLOSSUS	棱镜巨像
Light bends around it.	光线在它周围扭曲。
RUIN GOLEM	遗迹魔像
The old citadel's last guard.	古老要塞的最后守卫。
The last boss: the ruler of the storm.	最终首领：风暴的主宰。
MIXED RAIN	混合雨
A Slime Rain of Blue and Moss Slimes together.	蓝史莱姆和苔藓史莱姆一起落下的史莱姆雨。
Get the spot on screen and sweep it with *area damage*.	让落点进入屏幕，用*范围伤害*一扫而空。
EMBER RAIN	余烬雨
A Slime Rain of *Ember Slimes*: tough, but rich.	一场由*余烬史莱姆*组成的史莱姆雨：很强，但很肥。
Bring your *best damage*: it's worth it.	拿出你的*最强输出*：绝对值得。
GOLDEN RAIN	黄金雨
*{0} Golden Slimes* fall, and they all *run*!	*{0}只黄金史莱姆*从天而降，然后全都*开溜*！
*Dash* after them one at a time and catch them!	逐个*冲刺*追上去，把它们抓住！
STAMPEDE	滚石狂潮
Rocks don't stop. Neither do these.	滚石不停，它们也停不下来。
WANTED!	悬赏！
A slime with a price on its head.	一只脑袋很值钱的史莱姆。
Somebody stole a sack of gold, and he's getting away.	有人偷了一袋金币，正准备开溜。
SWARM	怪潮
Tiny slimes, lots of them.	小史莱姆，一大堆。
A named outlaw with a bounty on its head.	有名有姓的亡命之徒，身负悬赏。
