Cards	卡牌
[LMB] *Left click*: your squad dashes toward the cursor.	[LMB] *点击*：小队朝鼠标方向冲刺。
HOW TO USE IT	使用方法
Dash to a *pack* or a *Golden Slime*, or away from a *Stone*.	冲向*怪群*或*黄金史莱姆*，或者远离*岩石史莱姆*。
[RMB] *Right-click* a slime: it flies to the cursor and *splashes* where it lands.	[RMB] *点击*史莱姆：它会飞向鼠标位置，落地时造成*溅射*。
A *Stone* is the best ammo: throw it into the *biggest pack*!	*岩石史莱姆*是最好的弹药：把它扔进*最大的怪群*！
Place him: he *walks* by himself, shouts a *War Cry* at one hero and *throws* slimes into packs.	放置后，他会自行*游走*，对一位英雄发出*战吼*，并把史莱姆*扔*进怪群。
A hero he shouts at *glows*: it attacks *faster*.	被他战吼的英雄会*发光*：攻击*更快*。
ARROW RAIN	箭雨
The Archers' *ULTIMATE*: click its tile or press [{0}], then *left click* where it lands.	弓箭手的*终极技能*：点击技能图标或按 [{0}]，再用*左键*点击落点。
Save it for a *big pack* or the *boss*.	留给*大群史莱姆*或*首领*。
STORM CALL	召唤风暴
The Mages' *ULTIMATE*: click its tile or press [{0}]: bolts strike the slimes on screen.	法师的*终极技能*：点击技能图标或按 [{0}]，闪电就会劈向屏幕上的史莱姆。
Fire it when the screen is *full* or the boss is near.	等屏幕上*挤满*史莱姆或首领靠近时再释放。
CHEST METALS	宝箱材质
Fill the chest in *one run*: it turns *Silver*, then *Gold*.	在*一局*内装满宝箱：它会升级为*白银*宝箱，再升级为*黄金*宝箱。
More loot, better metal: a bigger *bonus* when it bursts.	战利品越多，材质越好：爆开时*奖励*越丰厚。
Item bags drop from slimes: *equip* their items on your heroes.	史莱姆会掉落物品袋：把里面的物品*装备*给英雄。
Open the *WARBAND* tab at camp after a run.	一局结束后，在营地打开*战团*标签页。
At the Warband's *forge*, refine an item: more power each step.	在战团的*锻造炉*精炼物品：每精炼一级，威力都会提升。
High refines can *fail*: refine with spare gold.	高等级精炼可能*失败*：用闲钱来精炼吧。
Slimes drop their own *cards*: slot them for bonuses.	史莱姆会掉落专属*卡牌*：装进卡套即可获得加成。
Slot the cards that fit your squad in the *CARDS* tab.	在*卡牌*标签页装入适合你小队的卡牌。
