Walk your squad *near loot*: its *magnet* sends it to the *chest at camp*. Fill its bar in *one run* and it opens as a *Silver* or *Gold* chest when time runs out!	让小队走到*战利品附近*：*磁力*会把它送进*营地的宝箱*。在*一局*内填满宝箱进度条，时间结束时它就会以*白银宝箱*或*黄金宝箱*开启！
Walk over the coins: your squad's *magnet* pulls them into your *chest*.	走过金币：小队的*磁力*会把它们吸进你的*宝箱*。
GRAB THE LOOT	拾取战利品
GOT IT!	到手了！
She stays by your side and shoots the *nearest slime* in her range.	她会守在你身边，射击射程内*最近的史莱姆*。
YOUR ARCHER	你的弓箭手
Fill this bar in *one run*: each mark makes the chest you open at the end better, *Silver* then *Gold*: *more gold*!	在*一局*内填满这条进度条：每到一个刻度，局末开启的宝箱就升一级，先是*白银*，再是*黄金*：*金币更多*！
CHEST TIERS	宝箱品级
The boss waits in its *lair*. Beat it in *one run* to open *Level {0}*!	首领在它的*巢穴*里等着你。在*一局*内击败它，即可开启*第{0}关*！
MOSSBACK!	苔背巨兽！
It *heals* after every run, so beat it in *one run*. Too tough? *Upgrade* at camp and come back!	每局结束后它都会*回血*，所以要在*一局*内击败它。打不过？回营地*强化*后再来！
BOSS HP	首领HP
Out here slimes have *×{0} HP* but drop *×{1} gold*. Your squad is still weak: it would ^waste shots^ on them.	这里的史莱姆*HP×{0}*，但*金币×{1}*。你的小队还太弱：打它们只会^白费火力^。
Hunt where HP is ~green~, *upgrade at camp*, then come back for the big gold!	先在HP显示~绿色~的地方狩猎，*回营地强化*，再回来赚大钱！
The *HP* of each slime you see: ~green~ easy, *gold* slow, ^red^ too tough for now.	你看到的每只史莱姆的*HP*：~绿色~轻松，*金色*费劲，^红色^暂时打不过。
*Lots of gold*, and it splits into *{0} slimes*. But its HP is huge: lead your squad right next to it!	*金币很多*，还会分裂成*{0}只史莱姆*。但它HP极高：带小队贴到它身边！
They crowd together in *nests*. Little gold each, but perfect for *area attacks*.	它们挤在*窝*里。每只金币不多，但正适合*范围攻击*。
PACK SLIMES	群居史莱姆
His lightning hits *every slime in a circle*. Lead your squad to *crowds*!	他的闪电会击中*圆圈内的所有史莱姆*。带小队冲进*怪群*！
He gathers the slimes into *one big group*. Your heroes hit his *pack* first!	他会把史莱姆聚成*一大群*。英雄们会优先攻击他*聚起的那群*！
GUARDIAN	守护者
Rolling *Stone Slimes* soak up your hits. Move your squad *out of their path*!	滚动的*岩石史莱姆*会吸收你的攻击。让小队*避开它们的路线*！
STAMPEDE!	滚石狂潮！
Kill the marked slime *on your screen* for a *huge bounty* before it escapes!	趁标记的史莱姆逃走前，在*屏幕上*消灭它，拿下*巨额赏金*！
Slimes killed *inside the glowing ring* drop *×{0} gold*. Fight there!	在*发光圆环内*击杀的史莱姆掉落*金币×{0}*。就在那里战斗！
GOLD VEIN!	金矿脉！
Keep the *thief* on your screen: every hit spills *coins*, a kill bursts his *sack*!	让*小偷*留在屏幕上：每一击都会洒出*金币*，击杀还会撑破他的*钱袋*！
TREASURE GOBLIN!	宝藏哥布林！
~Tiny slimes~ pour in. *Easy gold* - lightning clears them by the dozen!	~小史莱姆~蜂拥而至。*轻松赚钱*——闪电一劈就是一大片！
Walk over it: your *magnet* grabs it. It opens when the run ends. Equip items in the *WARBAND*.	走过去：*磁力*会把它吸过来。本局结束时打开。在*战团*中装备物品。
ITEM BAG!	物品袋！
A rare *refine ore*! Walk over it: refines from *+{0}* in the *WARBAND* need it.	稀有的*精炼矿石*！走过去拾取：在*战团*中精炼到*+{0}*以上需要它。
ORIDECON!	神之金属！
Your *screen*, the *camp*, and the boss's *lair* once found. Hold *TAB* for the big map!	显示你的*屏幕*、*营地*，以及找到后的首领*巢穴*。按住*TAB*查看大地图！
THE MINIMAP	小地图
That *rumble* and the shadow at the edge: something *big* lives far from camp. *Follow it!*	那阵*隆隆声*和边缘的黑影：有个*大家伙*住在远离营地的地方。*跟过去！*
FEEL THAT?	感觉到了吗？
Press [Q] to *pull* the slimes near your cursor into *one tight group*!	按 [Q] 把鼠标附近的史莱姆*聚拢*成*紧密的一团*！
Hand empty? *Click* the ground again: the hero you placed *first* moves there.	手牌空了？再次*点击*地面：*最先*放置的英雄会移动过去。
*Drag* to move more of them along a line.	*拖动*可让更多英雄沿一条线移动。
MOVE A HERO	移动英雄
Your heroes now land with a *STOMP*: every slime around the landing gets *hurt*. Drop them right *into a crowd*!	现在英雄落地时会*重踏*：落点周围的史莱姆都会*受伤*。直接把他们放进*怪群*！
Each hero stomps once every *{0} seconds*. The *dashed ring* at your cursor shows where it hits.	每位英雄每*{0}秒*重踏一次。鼠标处的*虚线圈*显示重踏范围。
HARD LANDING!	硬着陆！
Your *Barbarian* is in your hand: place him! He *walks* by himself, shouts a *War Cry* at one hero (it glows and attacks *faster*) and *throws* slimes into packs.	*野蛮人*已在你的手牌中：放置他吧！他会自行*游走*，对一位英雄发出*战吼*（英雄会发光，攻击*更快*），还会把史莱姆*扔*进怪群。
THE BARBARIAN	野蛮人
Press [E] to use a *Fly Wing*: you fly to a *random spot* of the map!	按 [E] 使用*苍蝇翅膀*：你会飞到地图上的*随机地点*！
A *second Archer* joins the squad!	*第二名弓箭手*加入小队！
A SECOND ARCHER!	第二名弓箭手！
Your *{0} Archers* became one *HUNTER*! His arrows fly *through* the slimes they hit.	*{0}名弓箭手*转职为一名*猎手*！她的箭会*贯穿*命中的史莱姆。
He keeps every upgrade and deals *+{0}%* damage.	保留所有强化，伤害*+{0}%*。
JOB CHANGE!	转职！
GREAT!	太棒了！
Your *{0} Mages* became one *WIZARD*! His lightning strikes a *bigger area*.	*{0}名法师*转职为一名*巫师*！他的闪电打击*范围更大*。
Your *{0} Rogues* became one *ASSASSIN*! He *finishes off* slimes low on HP.	*{0}名盗贼*转职为一名*刺客*！他会*收割*残血的史莱姆。
Your *{0} Beast Masters* became one *BEAST LORD*! He sends *two wolves* on every hunt.	*{0}名驯兽师*转职为一名*兽王*！每次狩猎他都会派出*两只狼*。
Your *{0} Merchants* became one *BLACKSMITH*! His hammer *shakes the ground*.	*{0}名商人*转职为一名*铁匠*！他的铁锤能*震撼大地*。
Your *{0} Necromancers* became one *LICH*! He raises a *bigger army*, Kings too.	*{0}名死灵法师*转职为一名*巫妖*！他能唤起*更庞大的亡灵大军*，连史莱姆王也不例外。
He dashes from slime to slime and cuts them *one at a time*. Great on *tough slimes*!	他在史莱姆之间来回突进，*逐个*斩杀。对付*强壮的史莱姆*很拿手！
His *wolf* hunts *OFF screen* and brings the *loot* back to you!	他的*狼*会在*屏幕外*狩猎，把*战利品*叼回给你！
He hits *harder* the *fuller your chest* is: *×{0}* at a full chest!	*宝箱越满*，他打得*越狠*：宝箱满时伤害*×{0}*！
Slimes that fall near him *rise again* and fight *for you*!	在他附近倒下的史莱姆会*再次站起*，*为你*而战！
Your *Goblin* joins the squad and runs for the *loot your magnet left*, even just off screen!	*哥布林*加入小队，会跑去捡*磁力漏掉的战利品*，刚出屏幕的也不放过！
GOBLIN	哥布林
*Hit it fast!* Every hit pays *gold*, until it snaps shut.	*快打它！*每一击都会掉*金币*，直到它合上嘴。
MIMIC!	宝箱怪！
A rare *MVP*! Hunt it down for *big rewards*: gold, an item bag and *Oridecon*.	稀有的*MVP*！猎杀它可获得*丰厚奖励*：金币、物品袋和*神之金属*。
MVP!	MVP！
It *heals* the slimes around it. Take it out *first*!	它会*治疗*周围的史莱姆。*优先*干掉它！
It *steals coins* from the ground! *Kill it* to get them all back.	它会*偷走地上的金币*！*干掉它*就能全部拿回来。
BANDIT SLIME!	盗贼史莱姆！
It *fades* now and then, and your heroes can't hit it. Hit it while it's *solid*!	它会不时*隐去*，这时英雄打不中它。趁它*显形*时攻击！
When it dies it *splits into shards*. Finish them all for *more gold*!	它死亡时会*碎成碎片*。全部清掉可获得*更多金币*！
It *grows* bigger and richer over time: more HP, but *more gold* too!	它会随时间*膨胀*，越长越大也越来越肥：HP更多，但*金币也更多*！
Its *armor* soaks your hits. Hit it *a few times* to break it, then it takes *full damage*!	它的*铠甲*会吸收你的攻击。多打*几下*破甲，之后就能造成*全额伤害*！
It hops *fast and far*, but it pays *more gold*. Keep it on your screen!	它跳得*又快又远*，但掉落*更多金币*。别让它离开屏幕！
*ARROW RAIN* charges during runs. When it's *READY*: *click* its tile or press [{0}], then *left click* where it lands!	*箭雨*会在每局中充能。显示*就绪*时：*点击*技能图标或按 [{0}]，再用*左键*点击落点！
ULTIMATES	终极技能
Click a glowing skill to buy it. Try *Eagle Eye*: {0} sure crits an Archer a cry.	点击发光的技能即可购买。试试*鹰眼*：每次战吼让弓箭手必定暴击{0}次。
A new level is unlocked! Pick levels here: later ones have *tougher slimes* and *more gold*.	新关卡已解锁！在这里选择关卡：越往后*史莱姆越强*，*金币也越多*。
Equip the items from your *item bags* on your heroes here.	在这里把*物品袋*中的物品装备给英雄。
A *must-have*: [LMB] *left click* to *dash* toward the cursor.	*必备技能*：[LMB] *点击*即可朝鼠标方向*冲刺*。
Beat *Mossback* in *one run* to open *Level {0}*!	在*一局*内击败*苔背巨兽*，即可开启*第{0}关*！
Spare gold? *Refine* your heroes' items in the *WARBAND*: each *+* makes them stronger!	有闲钱？在*战团*中*精炼*英雄的物品：每多一个*+*，就更强一分！
THE FORGE	锻造炉
New: the *Shop*! *Boosts* and *baits* work in your *next run*: one boost and one bait a run.	新功能：*商店*！*增益*和*诱饵*在*下一局*生效：每局可用一个增益和一个诱饵。
Fresh stock after every run. Gambles open at once!	每局结束后都会补货。盲盒当场开启！
Track it during your runs (*top of the screen*).	在每局中查看进度（*屏幕顶部*）。
