Move your *view* with [W] [A] [S] [D] or the *arrow keys*.	用 [W] [A] [S] [D] 或*方向键*移动*视野*。
Hold [W] [A] [S] [D] or *drag with the right button* to move your *view*: more slimes out there! Heroes left behind *drop back in by themselves*.	按住 [W] [A] [S] [D] 或*按住右键拖动*来移动*视野*：外面还有更多史莱姆！掉队的英雄会*自动重新降落*。
A *bubble* shields the boss while its *guards* stand. Drop your heroes *next to a guard*: they hit the *nearest* one!	只要*护卫*还在，首领就有*泡泡*护体。把英雄投放到*护卫旁边*：他们会攻击*最近*的那个！
Only the *real one's crown glints*. Drop your heroes *next to it*: they hit it, the fakes ^pop^!	只有*真身的王冠会闪光*。把英雄投放到*它旁边*：他们会攻击它，假货会^破掉^！
Drop your heroes by the real one next time!	下次把英雄投放到真身旁边！
YOUR SQUAD LOOKS READY!	你的小队看起来准备好了！
NOT READY YET: UPGRADE YOUR SQUAD FIRST	还没准备好：先强化你的小队
Win and the run ends. Lose and the hunt goes on.	获胜则本局结束，失败则继续狩猎。
It had {0}% HP left. Keep hunting, try again next run!	它的HP还剩{0}%。继续狩猎，下一局再来！
^A win ends the run^. Lose, and the hunt goes on: try again next run!	^获胜后本局结束^。失败了也能继续狩猎：下一局再来！
A win ends the run. Lost? The hunt goes on: try again next run!	获胜后本局结束。输了？继续狩猎：下一局再来！
[LMB] place or move a hero, [RMB] drag: move the view, [{0}] [{1}] ultimates, [SPACE] at a lair: challenge.	[LMB] 放置或移动英雄，[RMB] 拖动：移动视野，[{0}] [{1}] 终极技能，在巢穴按 [SPACE]：挑战。
place heroes	放置英雄
Right drag:	右键拖动：
HEAVY	大幅
NO SCREEN FLASHES, SOFT STEADY LIGHTNING	无屏幕闪光，闪电柔和平稳
GAME COMPLETE!	游戏通关！
Beat the level's *boss* in *one run* to finish the game!	在*一局*内击败本关*首领*，即可通关游戏！
Beat *Mossback* in *one run* to finish the game!	在*一局*内击败*苔背巨兽*，即可通关游戏！
The boss waits in its *lair*. Beat it in *one run* to finish the game!	首领在它的*巢穴*里等着你。在*一局*内击败它，即可通关游戏！
